WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.175
InfinityGAN makes five contributions.

00:00:04.255 --> 00:00:08.430
First, it reframes generation as disentangling
global appearance, local structure,

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:12.685
and fine texture, each with a dedicated component.

00:00:12.765 --> 00:00:16.940
Second,

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:21.195
a structure synthesizer built as a neural implicit
function driven by continuous coordinates,

00:00:21.275 --> 00:00:25.450
so any sub-region can be queried directly.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:29.705
Third, a padding-free generator removing all zero-padding,

00:00:29.785 --> 00:00:33.960
letting patches synthesize independently yet
combine seamlessly.

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:38.215
Fourth, a scale-invariant FID metric for sizes
where no real reference images exist.

00:00:38.295 --> 00:00:42.470
Finally, applications the design unlocks, from
spatial style fusion to outpainting.
